# H3 (run 3 of 3): the AUDITS-OFF HANG SHAPES of an interleaved prefill at eight seats on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-levern-time-gate (the nine levers, the quad blocks, 262k windows, QWEN_FAST_LEVER_N=1 at the 0.5 prefill share). The shapes (levern_*):
# a decoder finishes MID-prefill of a 64,000-token arrival (the plugin slot frees and the partial's row may move), every decoder finishes mid-prefill (the hook closes between two chunks and the final step builds a fresh one),
# the client drops a 120,000-token cold prefill 20 s in and a follow-up completes (the abort frees the gate, the scratch owner and the KV reservation), a 5,000-token prompt arrives during an in-flight prefill (it queues, then
# runs), and a 36,000-token prompt asked for ONE token (the request ends at its seed after 17 chunks); then the quad blocks' mix (concurrent8_steady) and the drain shape. Each run follows its own all-four reset.
# READ: three CONSECUTIVE completions (H1 to H3), every stream at budget, c2_smoke_check clean (the engaged markers, the route ledger, the alternation, zero programs compiled by a step, a quad marker per block), no
# watchdog or replay-deadline exit, no "Lever N REFUSED" line, zero owner refusals. No stall watch on this profile: a stall waits for the job timeout and records nothing, which is itself the finding.
# Duration (estimate): 90 min. Stop rule: one stall stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/lever-n four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/lever-n and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-lever-n-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/lever-n commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-lever-n-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-levern-time-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,levern_decoder_finishes,levern_all_decoders_finish,levern_cancel_mid_prefill,levern_arrival_during_prefill,levern_seed_stops,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_drain
